  m_text: During any base game spin, there is a chance 2 reels will become wild.
    Wilds substitute for all symbols except BONUS and JACKPOT. If a BONUS or JACKPOT
    symbol would land in a space where a wild appears, it counts as both a wild and
    that symbol.
