  m_text: 'This game requires an additional bonus bet wager to play. This wager is
    equal to 15 times the bet per line.

    The total stake wagered is equal to
    (25 lines* bet/line) + the Bonus Bet. The total stake wagered buys all bonus
    features and all pays on 25 paylines. Malfunction voids all pays and plays.'
