  m_text: Player is awarded 5 free games. During the 1st free game, reel 5 is wild.
    During the 2nd free game, the 4th and 5th reels are wild. During the 3rd free
    game, the 3rd and 4th reels are wild. During the 4th free game, the 2nd and 3rd
    reels are wild. During the 5th free game, the Island 2nd reels are wild. BONUS
    and JACKPOT are not available during the Smooth Criminal Free Games. Smooth Criminal
    Free Games reels differ from the base game reels.
